{"seq":3,"slug":"few-shot-learning","title":"少样本学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/prompt-engineering/few-shot-learning","wordCount":813,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"少样本学习\">少样本学习</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>少样本学习的概念体系围绕「示例如何起作用」展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>上下文学习（ICL）</strong>：模型仅凭提示中的示例就能执行新任务，不更新任何参数。</li>\n<li><strong>示例数量分级</strong>：Zero-shot（0）、One-shot（1）、Few-shot（2-10）到微调（100-100K+），是「用提示换参数」的连续谱。</li>\n<li><strong>任务模板假说</strong>：主流解释认为预训练让模型内化了大量任务模式，示例的作用是「定位」到正确的模式。</li>\n<li><strong>示例选择策略</strong>：随机、相似度、多样性、难度递进四种，直接决定 few-shot 效果的上限。</li>\n<li><strong>检索增强提示</strong>：把 RAG 用在示例库上，动态检索与当前查询最相关的示例，是 few-shot 的最佳实践。</li>\n<li><strong>示例顺序</strong>：最相关的示例放在最接近查询的位置（最后）效果最好，因为模型对近期上下文注意力更强。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括其边界：<strong>few-shot 用上下文而非梯度来「教」模型，因此示例的数量、质量、顺序与选取方式共同构成它的全部调控空间。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是少样本学习\">什么是少样本学习</h2><p>少样本学习（Few-shot Learning）也称上下文学习（In-Context Learning, ICL），是 LLM 最强大的能力之一——通过在提示中提供少量示例，模型就能理解并执行新任务，无需任何参数更新。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 少样本提示&#10;        E1[&quot;示例 1: 输入 → 输出&quot;]&#10;        E2[&quot;示例 2: 输入 → 输出&quot;]&#10;        E3[&quot;示例 3: 输入 → 输出&quot;]&#10;        Q[&quot;新输入&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    E1 &amp; E2 &amp; E3 &amp; Q --&gt; LLM[&quot;LLM&quot;]&#10;    LLM --&gt; A[&quot;预测输出&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 少样本提示\n        E1[\"示例 1: 输入 → 输出\"]\n        E2[\"示例 2: 输入 → 输出\"]\n        E3[\"示例 3: 输入 → 输出\"]\n        Q[\"新输入\"]\n    end\n    E1 &amp; E2 &amp; E3 &amp; Q --&gt; LLM[\"LLM\"]\n    LLM --&gt; A[\"预测输出\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>学习方式</th>\n<th>示例数量</th>\n<th>是否更新参数</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Zero-shot</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>简单通用任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>One-shot</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>格式化任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Few-shot</td>\n<td>2-10</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>复杂定制任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微调</td>\n<td>100-100K+</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>深度领域适配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"上下文学习原理\">上下文学习原理</h2><p>上下文学习的工作机制仍是活跃的研究领域。主流假说认为，预训练让模型内化了大量&quot;任务模板&quot;，few-shot 示例帮助模型&quot;定位&quot;到正确的任务模板：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 模型内部&#10;        PT[&quot;预训练学到的海量任务模式&quot;]&#10;        PT --&gt; P1[&quot;分类模式&quot;]&#10;        PT --&gt; P2[&quot;翻译模式&quot;]&#10;        PT --&gt; P3[&quot;摘要模式&quot;]&#10;        PT --&gt; Pn[&quot;...更多模式&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    Examples[&quot;Few-shot 示例&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;激活&quot;| P2&#10;    P2 --&gt; Output[&quot;执行翻译任务&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 模型内部\n        PT[\"预训练学到的海量任务模式\"]\n        PT --&gt; P1[\"分类模式\"]\n        PT --&gt; P2[\"翻译模式\"]\n        PT --&gt; P3[\"摘要模式\"]\n        PT --&gt; Pn[\"...更多模式\"]\n    end\n    Examples[\"Few-shot 示例\"] --&gt;|\"激活\"| P2\n    P2 --&gt; Output[\"执行翻译任务\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def format_few_shot(examples, query, task_description=&quot;&quot;):&#10;    prompt = &quot;&quot;&#10;    if task_description:&#10;        prompt += f&quot;{task_description}\\n\\n&quot;&#10;&#10;    for inp, out in examples:&#10;        prompt += f&quot;输入: {inp}\\n输出: {out}\\n\\n&quot;&#10;&#10;    prompt += f&quot;输入: {query}\\n输出:&quot;&#10;    return prompt&#10;&#10;sentiment_examples = [&#10;    (&quot;这家餐厅的菜太好吃了！&quot;, &quot;正面&quot;),&#10;    (&quot;等了一个小时才上菜，服务太差了&quot;, &quot;负面&quot;),&#10;    (&quot;价格还行，味道一般般&quot;, &quot;中性&quot;),&#10;]&#10;&#10;prompt = format_few_shot(&#10;    sentiment_examples,&#10;    &quot;环境很好但菜品让人失望&quot;,&#10;    task_description=&quot;判断以下评论的情感倾向（正面/负面/中性）：&quot;&#10;)&#10;print(prompt)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> format_few_shot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(examples, query, task_description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task_description:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">task_description</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\n\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inp, out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> examples:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"输入: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">inp</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">输出: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">out</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\n\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"输入: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">query</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">输出:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prompt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sentiment_examples </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"这家餐厅的菜太好吃了！\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"正面\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"等了一个小时才上菜，服务太差了\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"负面\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"价格还行，味道一般般\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"中性\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> format_few_shot(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sentiment_examples,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"环境很好但菜品让人失望\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    task_description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"判断以下评论的情感倾向（正面/负面/中性）：\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(prompt)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"示例选择策略\">示例选择策略</h2><p>示例的质量和相关性直接影响 few-shot 效果。以下是常用的示例选择方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>随机选择</td>\n<td>从数据池随机采样</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相似度选择</td>\n<td>按语义相似度检索</td>\n<td>最相关</td>\n<td>需要嵌入模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多样性选择</td>\n<td>覆盖不同类别</td>\n<td>全面</td>\n<td>可能不够相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>难度递进</td>\n<td>从简到难排列</td>\n<td>渐进学习</td>\n<td>需要人工排序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def select_by_similarity(query_embedding, example_embeddings, examples, k=3):&#10;    similarities = np.dot(example_embeddings, query_embedding)&#10;    top_indices = np.argsort(similarities)[-k:][::-1]&#10;    return [examples[i] for i in top_indices]&#10;&#10;def select_by_diversity(examples, k=3):&#10;    selected = [examples[0]]&#10;    remaining = list(range(1, len(examples)))&#10;&#10;    while len(selected) &lt; k and remaining:&#10;        best_idx = remaining[0]&#10;        remaining.remove(best_idx)&#10;        selected.append(examples[best_idx])&#10;&#10;    return selected&#10;&#10;np.random.seed(42)&#10;query_emb = np.random.randn(768)&#10;example_embs = np.random.randn(20, 768)&#10;examples = [f&quot;示例_{i}&quot; for i in range(20)]&#10;&#10;similar = select_by_similarity(query_emb, example_embs, examples, k=3)&#10;print(f&quot;相似度选择: {similar}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> select_by_similarity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query_embedding, example_embeddings, examples, k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shi